1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:04,860
The Final Battle
The Earth will be used to generate an endless supply of core metal.

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:09,381
And I will save our people of steel... from the threat of extinction!

3
00:00:09,381 --> 00:00:10,570
Is that your goal?

4
00:00:10,864 --> 00:00:14,589
Yes. It is my dream to reconstruct planet Machina!

5
00:00:14,589 --> 00:00:18,702
And you don't care... that the people and creatures of this planet have to disappear for that dream?!

6
00:00:18,702 --> 00:00:23,588
It's a small sacrifice I'm willing to make for a bigger goal.

7
00:00:23,704 --> 00:00:25,000
A small sacrifice?!

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:25,454
Hm?

9
00:00:25,454 --> 00:00:27,864
We're all doing our best just to live our lives!

10
00:00:27,864 --> 00:00:30,088
No one has the right to take that away!

11
00:00:30,088 --> 00:00:30,846
Jun!

12
00:00:30,846 --> 00:00:33,054
I... will never give up!!

13
00:00:33,054 --> 00:00:34,066
Humans...

14
00:00:34,165 --> 00:00:36,002
Metal Cardbots!

15
00:00:36,002 --> 00:00:37,838
I will protect them all!

16
00:00:42,533 --> 00:00:44,218
It's happening again...

17
00:00:44,218 --> 00:00:46,326
Jun! Unleash the forbidden power!

18
00:00:46,326 --> 00:00:47,890
That is the only way to defeat him!

19
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:48,899
Wait!

20
00:00:48,899 --> 00:00:52,253
The power sealed within the Metal Breath could be dangerous for him!

21
00:00:52,253 --> 00:00:53,720
-Haha! What are you saying?
-Jun!

23
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:57,954
We've faced countless dangers together, and overcame every last one!

24
00:00:57,954 --> 00:01:00,868
So long as we're together, there's nothing we can't do!

25
00:01:02,319 --> 00:01:02,868
Okay.

26
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,819
We haven't given up either!

27
00:01:04,819 --> 00:01:05,793
Guys!

28
00:01:06,317 --> 00:01:08,200
We still got an ace up our sleeve.

29
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:10,337
Don't count us out!

30
00:01:10,337 --> 00:01:11,414
We're always together!

31
00:01:11,414 --> 00:01:12,876
Yes. The real battle begins now!

32
00:01:12,876 --> 00:01:14,391
We show warmth of your heart-

33
00:01:14,391 --> 00:01:16,283
-to that big oaf over there!

34
00:01:16,283 --> 00:01:19,277
Jun, Blue Cop. Let's combine our strength!

35
00:01:23,674 --> 00:01:25,628
Oh... look at that!

36
00:01:25,628 --> 00:01:33,319
Jun's spirit and determination to never give up has combined with the spirit of the Metal Cardbots... to awaken... the forbidden power!

37
00:01:34,103 --> 00:01:35,329
Our hearts gathered...

38
00:01:35,329 --> 00:01:36,740
...as one!

39
00:01:47,472 --> 00:01:49,786
Ultimate Armor... setup! (FX-ua)

40
00:02:13,521 --> 00:02:16,471
All the power of planet Machina...

41
00:02:16,471 --> 00:02:18,199
is coursing through our veins.

42
00:02:20,865 --> 00:02:22,461
Jun, are you alright?

43
00:02:22,972 --> 00:02:23,913
Mhm!

44
00:02:25,622 --> 00:02:27,631
Get ready! Everyone!

45
00:02:29,146 --> 00:02:30,990
Edge Acceleration!

46
00:02:35,288 --> 00:02:36,949
You'll have to try harder than that!

47
00:02:36,949 --> 00:02:38,514
Mega Power Shield! (FX-megaTrucker shake bold)

48
00:02:41,370 --> 00:02:42,649
Spear Thrust! (FX-dexter shake bold)

49
00:02:47,514 --> 00:02:49,110
Captain's Cannon! (FX-blackHook shake bold)

50
00:02:55,985 --> 00:02:57,545
Keep up the pressure!

51
00:02:57,545 --> 00:02:58,848
Wild Raid! (FX-wildGuardy shake bold)

52
00:03:00,179 --> 00:03:01,139
Not bad!

53
00:03:03,538 --> 00:03:04,711
Twin Vulcan! (FX-busterGallon shake bold)

54
00:03:06,425 --> 00:03:07,657
Spinning Cutter! (FX-shadowX shake bold)

55
00:03:11,431 --> 00:03:12,816
Forceps Crush! (FX-megaAmbler shake bold)

56
00:03:14,830 --> 00:03:17,252
Buffalo Moonsault! (FX-buffaloCrush shake bold)

57
00:03:20,448 --> 00:03:21,865
Hammer Blaze! (FX-phoenixFire shake bold)

58
00:03:25,670 --> 00:03:27,585
Vulture Wings! (FX-fletaZ shake bold)

59
00:03:29,396 --> 00:03:31,788
You think this is enough to defeat me?

60
00:03:31,788 --> 00:03:33,520
We're not finished yet!

61
00:03:38,968 --> 00:03:40,151
Lightning... (FX-shake bold)

62
00:03:40,151 --> 00:03:41,280
Over... (FX-shakexl bold)

63
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,930
Strike!! (FX-shakexxl bold ua)

64
00:03:53,149 --> 00:03:54,889
How dare you...

65
00:03:56,307 --> 00:03:58,093
Incredible! So this is the forbidden powe-

66
00:03:58,093 --> 00:03:58,728
A-aagh! (FX-shake phoenixFire)

67
00:03:59,728 --> 00:04:00,948
Jun! Are you okay?!

68
00:04:01,366 --> 00:04:02,413
I'm okay!

69
00:04:02,413 --> 00:04:03,491
Aah! Blue Cop!

70
00:04:04,626 --> 00:04:05,455
Agh!

71
00:04:05,485 --> 00:04:06,467
What is it, Jun?!

72
00:04:07,139 --> 00:04:09,732
The Metal Breath! It's starting to burn!

73
00:04:09,732 --> 00:04:10,426
What?!

74
00:04:11,156 --> 00:04:14,217
Is the forbidden power going out of control?! Take off the Metal Breath, now!

75
00:04:14,217 --> 00:04:15,806
No! We keep fighting!

76
00:04:17,826 --> 00:04:18,762
Please, Jun!

77
00:04:18,762 --> 00:04:20,156
I won't take it off!

79
00:04:20,902 --> 00:04:23,271
Not until he's sealed!

80
00:04:23,963 --> 00:04:24,396
But...

81
00:04:24,636 --> 00:04:27,935
If we stop now, everything we've done would have all been for nothing!

82
00:04:27,935 --> 00:04:29,293
The day you and I met!

83
00:04:29,293 --> 00:04:31,446
The friends we made along the way!

84
00:04:31,446 --> 00:04:32,980
So you should know by now...

85
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:34,874
That I will never give up!

86
00:04:34,874 --> 00:04:38,752
For a world where humans and Metal Cardbots can live together!

87
00:04:38,752 --> 00:04:40,807
I will never give up on that dream!

88
00:04:44,846 --> 00:04:46,737
Such a world...

89
00:04:46,737 --> 00:04:48,120
Will never exist!!

90
00:04:49,980 --> 00:04:53,172
For this planet to become our new home...

91
00:04:53,172 --> 00:04:55,846
You humans cannot survive!

92
00:04:55,846 --> 00:04:56,889
No!

93
00:04:56,889 --> 00:04:58,786
I know we can exist alongside humans.

94
00:04:58,786 --> 00:05:01,993
They've been kind and compassionate enough... to accept us Metal Cardbots!

96
00:05:02,093 --> 00:05:03,555
Silence!!

97
00:05:10,523 --> 00:05:12,992
Infinite... (FX-ua shake)

98
00:05:12,992 --> 00:05:14,992
Punish!! (FX-ua shakexxl)

99
00:05:27,754 --> 00:05:29,206
Jun!

100
00:05:29,206 --> 00:05:30,273
Hey, guys!

101
00:05:30,862 --> 00:05:32,295
Don't get any closer, please!

102
00:05:32,295 --> 00:05:36,290
Ugh... the Star Crown is still alive...

103
00:05:36,290 --> 00:05:38,572
As long as I have it... my dream will...

104
00:05:38,572 --> 00:05:39,490
Huh...?!

105
00:05:41,415 --> 00:05:42,596
Blue Cop!

106
00:05:42,596 --> 00:05:43,603
Setup!

107
00:05:47,701 --> 00:05:51,228
Seems like... you still haven't learned your lesson.

108
00:05:51,228 --> 00:05:53,918
Heh. Looks like you didn't hear me.

109
00:05:53,918 --> 00:05:55,132
I will never give up!

110
00:05:58,944 --> 00:06:00,572
Infinity...

111
00:06:00,572 --> 00:06:02,317
Force...

112
00:06:05,175 --> 00:06:07,262
Megabolt... (FX-shake)

113
00:06:07,262 --> 00:06:09,139
Punch!! (FX-shakexl blueCop)

114
00:06:09,396 --> 00:06:11,418
Iron Cannon!!

115
00:06:33,903 --> 00:06:35,307
Metal Cardbot...

116
00:06:35,307 --> 00:06:36,675
Change Up!

117
00:06:37,687 --> 00:06:43,417
My dream... was to revive my home planet.

118
00:06:43,417 --> 00:06:45,286
Why do you get in my way?...

119
00:06:45,286 --> 00:06:48,983
Because it's my dream to live together with my friends!

120
00:06:48,983 --> 00:06:51,971
I just wanted to protect my dream too!

121
00:06:51,971 --> 00:06:54,201
I see...

122
00:06:54,201 --> 00:06:56,348
I concede.

123
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:04,100
Heavy Iron...

124
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:04,857
Sealed!

125
00:07:12,156 --> 00:07:13,219
Nooo!!

126
00:07:13,219 --> 00:07:15,785
What happened to Jun?! And everyone else?!

127
00:07:15,785 --> 00:07:18,288
I should have stopped him... Even if I had to drag him out of there.

128
00:07:18,288 --> 00:07:20,485
What the heck happened to Jun?

129
00:07:21,987 --> 00:07:23,853
Jun!!

130
00:07:23,853 --> 00:07:25,245
I can't believe he's been...

131
00:07:25,245 --> 00:07:26,473
What's wrong, guys?

132
00:07:26,473 --> 00:07:28,826
Well, you see... the thing is-

133
00:07:28,826 --> 00:07:30,442
What?! Jun?!

134
00:07:30,442 --> 00:07:31,480
You're alright?!

135
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,836
All thanks to my good friends!

136
00:07:33,836 --> 00:07:34,637
Blue Cop!

137
00:07:34,637 --> 00:07:37,403
Oh you little- I was so worried about you!

138
00:07:37,403 --> 00:07:40,997
I thought you got crushed out there!

139
00:07:40,997 --> 00:07:42,490
I'm sorry... Here.

140
00:07:42,490 --> 00:07:44,600
But hey! I'm back safe and sound.

141
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,715
Thank you...

142
00:07:47,899 --> 00:07:48,439
Here you go.

143
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:48,730
Eugh.

144
00:07:49,278 --> 00:07:50,812
I'm so glad you're okay!

145
00:07:50,812 --> 00:07:52,795
Welcome back, Jun!

146
00:07:52,795 --> 00:07:54,540
What's gotten into them?

147
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:57,737
It seems like a brave police officer managed to go inside and rescue the boy.

148
00:07:57,737 --> 00:07:59,542
Please, can I have an interview?

149
00:08:00,495 --> 00:08:02,689
That evening...

150
00:08:02,689 --> 00:08:05,311
we were given a huge scolding.

151
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:08,189
Huh?

152
00:08:08,189 --> 00:08:09,108
Jun?

153
00:08:10,875 --> 00:08:12,677
Mom... I can explain...

154
00:08:15,257 --> 00:08:17,305
It didn't hurt that much, Mom!

155
00:08:17,305 --> 00:08:19,136
I'm sure the scar will be gone in a week!

156
00:08:19,136 --> 00:08:20,271
Listen to me!

157
00:08:20,271 --> 00:08:22,985
I'll never forgive you if you put yourself in danger like that again!

158
00:08:22,985 --> 00:08:24,769
And I won't let you play with your friends ever again!

159
00:08:24,769 --> 00:08:26,889
What?!- Ah.. That hurt.

160
00:08:26,889 --> 00:08:28,235
Isn't that a bit much?

161
00:08:28,235 --> 00:08:29,754
Yuri! Please forgive Jun!

162
00:08:29,754 --> 00:08:30,449
Quiet!

163
00:08:30,449 --> 00:08:31,449
...okay...

164
00:08:31,697 --> 00:08:33,625
I'm really sorry.

165
00:08:33,625 --> 00:08:36,158
I know you just wanted to help your friends.

166
00:08:36,158 --> 00:08:38,230
But do you know how worried I was?

167
00:08:38,686 --> 00:08:40,423
I won't do it again, Mom...

168
00:08:41,709 --> 00:08:43,965
We also took care of the aftermath in secret.

169
00:08:43,965 --> 00:08:50,334
According to Buster Gallon, most of the Machinasium turned into ordinary rock when the Star Crown was destroyed.

170
00:08:50,334 --> 00:08:53,676
However, it seems like a few scattered pieces are still alive.

171
00:08:53,676 --> 00:08:55,619
Ugh. This is gonna take forever.

172
00:08:55,619 --> 00:08:58,312
Hey! Let's bet on who can find the most!

173
00:08:58,312 --> 00:08:59,721
Me sure to win!

174
00:08:59,721 --> 00:09:01,110
No way!

175
00:09:01,721 --> 00:09:07,238
Vera, who saw what happened that day, seems to believe that the dome was the base for an alien invasion.

176
00:09:07,238 --> 00:09:09,485
Well... she's kinda right!

177
00:09:09,485 --> 00:09:11,514
Ha! I heard it on TV!

178
00:09:11,514 --> 00:09:15,403
A bunch of underground elements had a chemical reaction with the methane gas and puffed up like bread!

179
00:09:15,403 --> 00:09:16,850
Vance, you're the smartest!

180
00:09:16,850 --> 00:09:17,576
Don't be fooled! They-

181
00:09:17,576 --> 00:09:19,370
See you later, Vera!

182
00:09:19,370 --> 00:09:20,769
We'll be off then!

183
00:09:20,769 --> 00:09:21,581
Jun! You saw it, didn't you?

184
00:09:21,581 --> 00:09:22,705
Aliens?

185
00:09:22,705 --> 00:09:25,201
I'm sure they exist! Space is huge, right?

186
00:09:25,201 --> 00:09:30,403
According to the Drake equation, there are 25,000 planets in this galaxy likely to have alien civilizations!

187
00:09:30,403 --> 00:09:31,985
Jun! We have a situation!

188
00:09:31,985 --> 00:09:32,886
Huh?! I know that voice!

189
00:09:32,886 --> 00:09:34,600
Uh, see ya!

190
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,288
Hey, wait!

191
00:09:36,634 --> 00:09:40,244
And now... we're doing a routine cleaning of the warehouse together!

192
00:09:40,244 --> 00:09:44,836
Since we have some new big friends joining us, we have to get on Uncle Edo's good side!

193
00:09:44,836 --> 00:09:48,224
Although... the big guy doesn't seem to have opened up yet.

194
00:09:49,264 --> 00:09:51,330
This stain just won't come out.

195
00:09:51,330 --> 00:09:54,450
Disappointing, Blue Cop. I'll show you how it's done!

196
00:09:54,519 --> 00:09:56,345
Why the long face over there?!

197
00:09:56,345 --> 00:09:58,720
This is just pathetic to watch.

198
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,460
I can't believe you're all playing along.

199
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:02,697
This is how we clean up on Earth. Why not give it a try?

200
00:10:02,697 --> 00:10:05,058
Do you really think I'd do something so pitiful?

201
00:10:05,058 --> 00:10:07,729
Haha! What, afraid you can't do it?

202
00:10:07,729 --> 00:10:08,379
What was that?

203
00:10:08,379 --> 00:10:10,203
Yeah! Can ya? Can ya?

204
00:10:10,203 --> 00:10:11,528
Hm. I don't think he can.

205
00:10:11,528 --> 00:10:12,858
What a persistent stain-

206
00:10:12,958 --> 00:10:13,687
Move it!

207
00:10:14,442 --> 00:10:17,825
I'll show you that I'm on a different level than those who would surrender to humans.

208
00:10:18,538 --> 00:10:21,240
You can't solve everything just by using force.

209
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,548
Here, try spraying some of-

210
00:10:22,548 --> 00:10:22,988
Woah, woah!

211
00:10:23,076 --> 00:10:25,961
Heh! Fire makes for the best cleaning agent!

212
00:10:25,961 --> 00:10:27,865
-Hahaha!
-Phoenix Fire! Red alert!

213
00:10:27,865 --> 00:10:28,207
Huh?!

214
00:10:28,207 --> 00:10:30,764
-Oh no, danger!
-Hey, you troublemakers! What do you think you're doing?!

215
00:10:30,764 --> 00:10:32,022
Dousing the fire!

216
00:10:34,245 --> 00:10:35,341
Uh...

217
00:10:35,341 --> 00:10:36,969
Jun! I think we have an emergency!

218
00:10:37,711 --> 00:10:39,894
Everyone, run for it!!

219
00:10:41,210 --> 00:10:48,580
You won't keep getting away with this!!

220
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:51,000
Phew! So we had to run all the way out here...

221
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:54,418
Yeah... and to think I ran away with you.

222
00:10:54,418 --> 00:10:57,432
Isn't that proof that you've become one of our friends?

223
00:10:58,918 --> 00:11:00,745
Look at the sky, Heavy Iron!

224
00:11:00,745 --> 00:11:01,610
Hmm?

225
00:11:01,610 --> 00:11:04,774
Planet Machina doesn't exist anymore.

226
00:11:04,774 --> 00:11:06,691
So now you have to live here on Earth with us!

227
00:11:06,691 --> 00:11:07,625
Jun?

228
00:11:07,625 --> 00:11:10,370
What point is there in trying to open up emotional wounds?

229
00:11:10,370 --> 00:11:10,956
But...

230
00:11:11,899 --> 00:11:12,447
Huh?

231
00:11:12,745 --> 00:11:16,932
We don't know how many Metal Cardbots are still drifting through the universe...

232
00:11:16,932 --> 00:11:19,139
Lost somewhere among the stars.

233
00:11:19,139 --> 00:11:23,409
Let's make it our role to give them a warm welcome when they arrive here on Earth!

234
00:11:23,409 --> 00:11:29,031
So let's work together, and create a world where humans and Metal Cardbots can coexist and be friends, Heavy Iron!

236
00:11:29,933 --> 00:11:33,985
I think... I'm starting to understand you.

237
00:11:34,932 --> 00:11:38,315
Let's work together. For the future of Metal Cardbots.

238
00:11:39,782 --> 00:11:41,729
Thank you, Heavy Iron!

239
00:11:41,903 --> 00:11:43,221
This is great!

240
00:11:43,221 --> 00:11:45,331
So we've made yet another incredible friend.

241
00:11:45,875 --> 00:11:48,230
Now can you give it a rest with the eyes?

242
00:11:48,230 --> 00:11:51,163
Hmph.

243
00:11:51,163 --> 00:11:53,517
Woah! Now you look more reasonable!

244
00:11:53,517 --> 00:11:54,767
Right?!

245
00:11:56,134 --> 00:11:57,956
Deus Machina...

246
00:11:57,956 --> 00:11:59,519
Was this the reason...

247
00:11:59,519 --> 00:12:01,100
That you chose him?

